---
// רשימת החוזים. Metadata only - the endpoint returns no ID numbers, no
// phones, no emails and no signed body, and this component asks for nothing
// more than it returns.
//
// Rendered from a <template> rather than innerHTML: the markup stays in the
// markup, and nothing from the server is ever parsed as HTML.
---

<section class="panel clist">
  <div class="clist__top">
    <h1 class="panel__title">רשימת חוזים</h1>
    <button class="btn btn--ghost clist__refresh" type="button" data-list-refresh>רענון</button>
  </div>

  <p class="form__status" data-list-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <p class="clist__empty" data-list-empty hidden>
    עוד לא נוצרו חוזים. התחילו ב״חוזה חדש״.
  </p>

  <ul class="clist__items" data-list></ul>

  <template data-row>
    <li class="citem">
      <div class="citem__head">
        <p class="citem__couple" data-cell="couple"></p>
        <span class="badge" data-cell="status"></span>
      </div>
      <dl class="citem__grid">
        <div><dt>תאריך האירוע</dt><dd data-cell="date"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>מקום</dt><dd data-cell="venue"></dd></div>
        <div><dt>סה"כ תמורה</dt><dd class="money" dir="ltr">₪ <span data-cell="total"></span></dd></div>
        <div><dt>נוצר</dt><dd data-cell="created"></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </li>
  </template>
</section>
